# Computed

An estimate computed from inputs.

◇

subclass_of_key: method

attributes:
    - key: computed_count
      name: Computed Count
      details: Number of inputs into this computation.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: computed_mean
      name: Computed Mean
      details: Middle of the computed bell curve.
      rules: "[unconstrained .. unconstrained] at 0.01 unit"
      type_spec: Real
    - key: computed_variance
      name: Computed Variance
      details: Shape of the computed bell curve.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 0.01 unit"
      type_spec: Real
